# AutoMap evaluation Stationeries: track only the .wxsp (Files/, Formats/, Settings/ and the
# .manifest are regenerated — Quantum Sync Stationery by Save as Stationery from the Designer Trial)
latest/local-trial-projects/WebWorks ePublisher AutoMap/Evaluation/*/Files/*
latest/local-trial-projects/WebWorks ePublisher AutoMap/Evaluation/*/Formats/*
latest/local-trial-projects/WebWorks ePublisher AutoMap/Evaluation/*/Settings/*
latest/local-trial-projects/WebWorks ePublisher AutoMap/Evaluation/*/*.manifest
# ...except the variant Stationery's chrome, which is its design source (ADR-0003): the three assets
# Reverb shows and the sass partials. scripts/sync_variant_stationery.py regenerates everything else
# from Quantum Sync Stationery. (Git cannot re-include below an excluded folder, hence the ladder.)
!latest/local-trial-projects/WebWorks ePublisher AutoMap/Evaluation/Quantum Sync Midnight Stationery/Files/toolbar-logo.svg
!latest/local-trial-projects/WebWorks ePublisher AutoMap/Evaluation/Quantum Sync Midnight Stationery/Files/footer-logo.svg
!latest/local-trial-projects/WebWorks ePublisher AutoMap/Evaluation/Quantum Sync Midnight Stationery/Files/favicon.png
